   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I have a model which is working fine, but the parameter definition is a little convoluted because I use lower and upper bounds and I use an explicit inv_logit (on the alpha/sigma weibull parameters).  My understanding is that this means inv_logit is happening twice which seems wasteful.  The original model had bounds on the parameters but used exp(alpha) and exp(sigma) instead which tended to blow up numerically in the early parts of the estimation.  The data for the weibull (&#39;delay&#39;) are in days and mostly under 1.5 years so overall the inv_logit(alpha)*10 and inv_logit(sigma)*365 are really reasonable boundaries and they&#39;re the ones I&#39;d like to enforce.  <br><br>My question is: how do I match up a linear model for alpha/sigma in (something like) the Weibull which has constraints on parameters (alpha/sigma &gt; 0).  <br><br>My own best answer so far is to drop the constraints on the parameters and keep the explicit inv_logit... (?)<br><br>Krzysztof<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">parameters </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  real</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> upper</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> alpha_0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n_provinces</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> alpha_province</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  real</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> upper</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> alpha_province_sigma</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  real</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> upper</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sigma_0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n_provinces</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sigma_province</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  real</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> upper</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sigma_province_sigma</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  real</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> upper</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> p_0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  real</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> upper</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> p_unscaled</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n_provinces</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n_deliveries</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\">   </span><span style=\"color:#800\">//</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  real</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> upper</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> p_unscaled_sigma</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">                        </span><span style=\"color:#800\">//</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>model </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">//original model: delay ~ weibull(alpha, sigma);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n_obs</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> alpha</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n_obs</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sigma</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n_obs</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  p_0 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> normal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  p_unscaled_sigma </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> gamma</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n_provinces </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\">       </span><span style=\"color:#800\">//</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    p_unscaled</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cauchy</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">p_unscaled_sigma</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  alpha_0 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> normal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  alpha_province </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> normal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">alpha_province_sigma</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  alpha_province_sigma </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> gamma</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  sigma_0 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> normal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  sigma_province </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> normal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sigma_province_sigma</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  sigma_province_sigma </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> gamma</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n_obs</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    alpha</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> inv_logit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">alpha_0 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> alpha_province</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">province_index</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]])</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    sigma</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> inv_logit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sigma_0 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sigma_province</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">province_index</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]])</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">365</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    p</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> inv_logit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">p_0 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> p_unscaled</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">province_index</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]][</span><span style=\"color:#000\">delivery_index</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]]);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n_obs </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    increment_log_prob</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">log_sum_exp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      log</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">p</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">])</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> weibull_log</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">delay</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">],</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> alpha</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">],</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sigma</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      log</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">p</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">])</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> uniform_log</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">delay</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">],</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">600</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">));</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><br><br></div>"
    ]
